{"4121100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fast & Fractured", "steam_appid": 4121100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into typical Spanish <strong>sun-baked </strong>places, and prepare for Fast and Fractured experience, a <strong>frenetic physics-based driving shooter</strong> for up to 8 contenders— in a chaotic multiplayer battle royale. Choose from 4 colorful characters, <strong>each sporting 2 unlockable skins</strong>, and battle it out across different maps <strong>inspired by</strong> stereotypical <strong>Spanish</strong> places like an <strong>old-school Spanish town, </strong>while having fun with cheeky elder-villager humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Drivers: </strong>Pick one of four quirky locals—each with two unique skins—and master their handling quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frenetic Physics Combat:</strong> Push, dash, and blast opponents into the dust, leveraging realistic weight, grip, and push-shot mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes</strong>: Jump into Single-Player Showdowns with up to 12 AI contenders, or host your own multiplayer lobby and battle friends in custom chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beloved Locales:</strong> Battle across iconic spots like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountain Village – A vibrant Spanish-inspired village where narrow streets, sun-baked tiles, and a bustling market set the scene—until a giant chicken shows up to ruin everyone’s day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf Volcano Island – A once-serene golf course based around an inactive volcano now turned chaotic battleground—complete with perfectly trimmed bushes and way too many statues of its “glorious” owner, Josefino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction Site– A dusty construction site buzzing with machinery, chaos, and a front-row audience of local grandpas who’ve made “watching the works” their favorite sport. They’re not working, but they sure have opinions on how everyone else should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant, Stereotypical Charm:</strong> Overflowing with Spanish jokes, elder-villager antics, and brightly colored, cartoon-inspired art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras/8573619aabe1b839af447a98c9c77377.avif?t=1762625150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras_big/8573619aabe1b839af447a98c9c77377.avif?t=1762625150 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quick Matches, Big Laughs:</strong> Perfect for streamers and content creators seeking dynamic, shareable moments. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Josefino: </strong>Charming and wealthy, Josefino has extravagant tastes, has tons of money to throw around and enjoys golfing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras/6cb6a4312c726ba086dc8687351c9449.avif?t=1762625150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras_big/6cb6a4312c726ba086dc8687351c9449.avif?t=1762625150 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maria Antonia: </strong>A loving and caring grandmother, Maria Antonia takes care of her grandchildren by cooking them tons of food, especially croquettes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras/e6188c9247fe45a172723a620b8b39b0.avif?t=1762625150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras_big/e6188c9247fe45a172723a620b8b39b0.avif?t=1762625150 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pepe:</strong> A retired farmer, Pepe loves taking strolls around his crops. He goes everywhere with his tractor and reminisces of his past self.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras/3920c7c93f3422e84a69ca7eda112da2.avif?t=1762625150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras_big/3920c7c93f3422e84a69ca7eda112da2.avif?t=1762625150 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Carme: </strong>Crazy for her chickens, Carme still tends to her farm and always has remedies for every sickness with herbs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras/c7802c988ae5a4ac2b517c38461099d9.avif?t=1762625150\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121100/extras_big/c7802c988ae5a4ac2b517c38461099d9.avif?t=1762625150 width=1560 height=878 /></span> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into typical Spanish <strong>sun-baked </strong>places, and prepare for Fast and Fractured experience, a <strong>frenetic physics-based driving shooter</strong> for up to 8 contenders— in a chaotic multiplayer battle royale. Choose from 4 colorful characters, <strong>each sporting 2 unlockable skins</strong>, and battle it out across different maps <strong>inspired by</strong> stereotypical <strong>Spanish</strong> places like an <strong>old-school Spanish town, </strong>while having fun with cheeky elder-villager humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Drivers: </strong>Pick one of four quirky locals—each with two unique skins—and master their handling quirks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frenetic Physics Combat:</strong> Push, dash, and blast opponents into the dust, leveraging realistic weight, grip, and push-shot mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Game Modes</strong>: Jump into Single-Player Showdowns with up to 12 AI contenders, or host your own multiplayer lobby and battle friends in custom chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beloved Locales:</strong> Battle across iconic spots like:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mountain Village – A vibrant Spanish-inspired village where narrow streets, sun-baked tiles, and a bustling market set the scene—until a giant chicken shows up to ruin everyone’s day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Golf Volcano Island – A once-serene golf course based around an inactive volcano now turned chaotic battleground—complete with perfectly trimmed bushes and way too many statues of its “glorious” owner, Josefino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction Site– A dusty construction site buzzing with machinery, chaos, and a front-row audience of local grandpas who’ve made “watching the works” their favorite sport. They’re not working, but they sure have opinions on how everyone else should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant, Stereotypical Charm:</strong> Overflowing with Span